{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unihorn is a gentle-yet-challenging 3D platformer where you play as a unicorn born with a speech difficulty\u2014and a dream of flying. To earn your wings, you must climb the ancient heights of the Flying Academy: a mystical, vertical world full of obstacles, quiet beauty, and fellow unicorns on their own journeys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn\u2019t about speed. It\u2019s about persistence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll stumble. You\u2019ll fall. But with every setback, you\u2019ll gain something new\u2014tiny shifts in strength, grace, or understanding. No enemies, no timers. Just you, your hooves, and a mountain that quietly asks: <i>Will you try again?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906700/extras/title2.png?t=1750424762\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906700/extras/unihorn1.gif?t=1750424762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906700/extras/title1.png?t=1750424762\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906700/extras/unihorn2.gif?t=1750424762\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906700/extras/title3.png?t=1750424762\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906700/extras/unihorn4.gif?t=1750424762\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/imag